# Review routing. With branch protection's "require review from code owners" on,
# a pull request touching these paths needs the owner's approval.

# Everything, by default.
*                                                        @owner

# The safety boundary: the files whose changes are security-sensitive. This is
# the one list; CONTRIBUTING.md and the pull request template point here.
# A checker compares the path-gated group with the "ask" list in
# .claude/settings.json and the "Edits prompt" lines in CLAUDE.md: keep the
# order and the spelling the same in all three.

# Path-gated: an edit prompts in .claude/settings.json.
/mods/council-of-elrond/hooks/rules/**                   @owner
/mods/council-of-elrond/hooks/config/defaults.ts         @owner
/mods/council-of-elrond/hooks/config/trust.ts            @owner
